    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA most spacious 4/5 bedroom bungalow on a private site in Abbeyside!Conveniently located on the popular Coolagh Road with direct access onto the N25, within a 10-12 min walk of the town centre, this detached home has a most private site enclosed by block walls with secure entrance gates.Inside, the property has an abundance of living space with 3 reception rooms on offer. The living room is to the front and is a grande room with windows to front and side. Off the living, there is a home office with a bay window to the garden.The kitchen is in the heart of the house and is adjoined by a small lounge on one side and a large open plan dining room/sun lounge on the opposite side. This is an impressive room with plenty of space for furniture and opens to the rear patio. Off the hallway, there are 4 ample size bedrooms (2 ensuite) and a bathroom and shower room. There is a 5th bedroom at the end of the hall that is currently set up as a utility room however could be converted back if required.Externally, the property has a large detached garage divided into 2 sections - workshop and storage. There is also a private patio area and ample car parking space in the driveway.Tara is a most spacious and private residence and bungalows in this location are hard to come by. Secluded from the road, this property has to be viewed to be appreciated. 217 sq.m. ( 2,336 sq. ft.) approx."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Prime location in Abbeyside on the Coolagh Road.</li><li>10-12 min walk to town.</li><li>Spacious home - 2,336 sq.ft approx. </li><li>Option of 5th bedroom if required.</li><li>3 reception rooms - living, lounge & sun lounge.</li><li>Footpath to town centre, Greenway, primary & secondary schools.</li><li>Private site with secure entrance walls, gates and driveway.</li><li>Large detached block built garage.</li><li>Patio area.</li><li>Mains services.</ul>"
      },
